    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U03-L08-ACTIVITY-023",
      "SourceSection": "8.4: Solve These Equations With Cube Roots in Them",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Without solving, identify 3 equations that you think would be the least difficult to solve and 3 equations that you think would be the most difficult to solve. Be prepared to explain your reasoning.",
